	(text "DMA mode offloads CPU usage but on the uC\nis only available in 12-bit mode. Fast mode\ncan measure signals up to 16-bit resolution\nwhich may be useful. Jumpers to select\nbetween the two modes. Only one should be\nbridged at a time"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
